  "subtitle": "Pizza with tinned tuna and sweet red onion",
  "excerpt": "Pizza tonno e cipolla is a southern Italian pizza with tinned tuna, sweet red onion, tomato, and mozzarella. It is a pantry pizza that appears simple and turns out to be one of the more satisfying combinations: the tuna gives substance, the onion sweetness, the tomato acidity. It is a home kitchen pizza rather than a restaurant pizza.",
