  "sourceNotes": "Pizza con tonno e cipolla is common throughout southern Italy, particularly in Campania and Sicily where tuna in olive oil is a standard pantry ingredient. It is a home-cooking pizza rather than a prestige pizzeria pizza and reflects the southern Italian tradition of using tinned tuna as a central ingredient.",
