  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pizza tonno e cipolla works because of the contrast between the mild, flaky tuna and the sweet-sharp red onion. Use tuna in olive oil rather than brine for the best result: the oil carries flavour and the tuna holds together better. The onion can be used raw (sweet, crunchy after baking) or marinated in olive oil for 20 minutes before topping."
          }
        ]
      },
